<li>Expanding Eye - A First Journey To The Mediterranean" (1952) Illustrated with photographs.</li>
<li>Habeas Corpus And Other Stories (1954) Eight Short Stories</li>
<li>Achilles His Armour (1955) (historical novel about Alcibiades and the Peloponnesian War).</li>
